  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The meme uses a photo of Tom Hanks with a stern expression and juxtaposes it with text criticizing Democratic policies on gun control. The text claims that Democrats who set the age of gun ownership at 21 are hypocritical because they allow 16-year-olds to vote on gun laws. This is a politically charged meme that attempts to delegitimize a specific political stance by implying inconsistency and moral hypocrisy. While it does not target individuals based on protected characteristics (race, gender, religion, etc.), it promotes a divisive political message that could incite polarization and harm constructive dialogue on gun policy. The intent is to persuade viewers to reject or criticize Democratic positions on gun control by highlighting perceived contradictions in their policy positions, which falls under the category of harmful political propaganda.",
